-- WoW Forever: quest items our live quests need that nothing drops here yet. Which creature drops each one, and how often,
-- is read from Wowhead's WoW Forever item and NPC pages (www.wowhead.com/forever, read 2026-11-19/20). Only drops Wowhead
-- counted at least twice. Chance = drops / kills Wowhead counted. For an item a quest needs, kills by players not on that quest
-- are in the count too, so the real chance is higher: a source below 10% gets half the best rate seen for that item
-- (ESTIMATED). Quest objective items drop only for players on the quest (QuestRequired 1); quest-starting items drop for all.
-- Many of these creatures come from data kit 0015 / Everlake (apply those first); a creature this world lacks is skipped.
-- A creature with no loot table gets one under its own entry. Rows that already exist are left alone. Safe to run again.
